g your dreams.\n[S18T4] (dia_id: D18:4)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, moments like this remind me why I got into music - making a difference and sharing my own story. It's exciting to get positive feedback and it gives me strength to keep going and reach more people. My journey's just getting started!\n[S18T5] (dia_id: D18:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! You've come a long way since we started talking music. What's next for you? Anything exciting coming up?\n[S18T6] (dia_id: D18:6)","text_sha256":"a5216068958c38194f6b8c2ed9566df0be6a10eda3e79a164cbe5c20db614597","timestamp":"2023-09-13T10:56:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":14,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S28T1]"],"text_sha256":"1658b74af70a07598f8905a8fa13ff8fdcaa70cff0e96354f7cfc45649d56ed1"},{"dia_ids":["D28:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S28T2]"],"text_sha256":"873d0c9b45e6c202b420b812865b173d2ec14760692535e22699f2d663e49682"},{"dia_ids":["D28:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S28T3]"],"text_sha256":"09da5fcbab997454bea494bb5f651fbdfe915eda016d6e18e4935055fe1d5ca2"},{"dia_ids":["D28:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":24,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S28T4]"],"text_sha256":"1d531ec64f80b7b42694116e5d128fae24502d0023936fbbb1aa6cdc12d798bb"},{"dia_ids":["D28:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":26,"source_locators":["[S28T5]"],"text_sha256":"bf1422df8f7bfdeda04549377f4f85c782cc15b636a908879a78bf294ecb969c"},{"dia_ids":["D28:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S28T6]"],"text_sha256":"912c78dcde8b5e59fa1d394bae41be6e72ff5c52d5fe564d726e691b1a12396b"}],"dia_ids":["D28:1","D28:2","D28:3","D28:4","D28:5","D28:6"],"evidence_id":"ev-dae5c901b1d313c88acc706519ee26016b5bb9bd07313fbe763e8a52a02f8b88","group_id":"session_28","line_end":31,"line_start":12,"observation_id