2] (dia_id: D28:2)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It was an awesome feeling seeing everyone come together to celebrate - super rewarding! Look at this photo showcasing how wonderfully we spent our time!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people dancing at a party]\n[S28T3] (dia_id: D28:3)\n\nDave: Wow, great job, Calvin! Congrats! What was it like when everyone was cheering you on?\n[S28T4] (dia_id: D28:4)\n\nCalvin: It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\n[Image caption: a photo of a group of people standing on top of a stage]\n[S28T5] (dia_id: D28:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\n[S28T6] (dia_id: D28:6)","text_sha256":"efb6c52f78c9be07eb4095cbb6ba753596edf4cfdb5f2a841edfbca34bbad3c1","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D16:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":14,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S16T1]"],"text_sha256":"f2b85768ebcf0d62e8a7546d671ecf74d98ddf1eda9b1afe8096fe39bf18890a"},{"dia_ids":["D16:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":18,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S16T2]"],"text_sha256":"43a83305062cd53bd27e10f3fb67d08ff50df5fcba8d8788e81c191b67b71421"},{"dia_ids":["D16:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":20,"source_locators":["[S16T3]"],"text_sha256":"59fa26084f3000756117f277aa18c26bb6c186bdd2f2412b99bd69c35d2f86ad"},{"dia_ids":["D16:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":24,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S16T4]"],"text_sha256":"9d37bc6a7b09d415149580b5d03998c96691e2039a2f64de54436f8dca4826e2"},{"dia_ids":["D16:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":27,"line_start":26,"source_locators":["[S16T5]"],"text_sha256":"39ec376d40c16d3aa2d23154f06baf1ec134da8e56e9772750c08de9df5f0b68"},{"dia_ids":["D16:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":29,"source_locato